            <tr>
                <td>JODI (Joan Heemskerk and Dirk Paesmans)</td>

                <td>
                    Glitch Aesthetics: Famous for creating, or simulating, code errors and browser crashes to expose the
                    underlying, chaotic structure of web pages.
                    Deconstructed Interface: Their work, such as wwwwwwwww.jodi.org (1995), deliberately distorts user
                    navigation, forcing users to treat the browser as a confusing, abstract, and often nonsensical
                    space.</td>

